{134}{Off a body near the IFS Zephyr.  I need some information about him.}{}{5}{}{136}{}
{135}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{136}{[looking at you warily]  Who was this man, anyhow?  You are not the only person who has been asking questions...}{[looking at you warily]  Who was this man, anyhow?  You are not the only person who has been asking questions...}{}{}{}{}
{137}{Who else has been here?}{}{5}{}{140}{}
{138}{There have been others looking for him?}{}{5}{}{140}{}
{139}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{140}{A couple of thugs came by right after the Zephyr left Caladon.  They wanted information about him.  When I refused to talk, they decided I needed a little encouragement [you see the pain in his eyes]  I do not know who they were...}{A couple of thugs came by right after the Zephyr left Caladon.  They wanted information about him.  When I refused to talk, they decided I needed a little encouragement [you see the pain in his eyes]  I do not know who they were...}{}{}{}{}
{141}{What did you tell them?}{}{5}{}{144}{}
{142}{What did they get out of you?}{}{5}{}{144}{}
{143}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{144}{I told them that I had made him a passport... that he had chosen Preston Radcliffe as his name, a gnome from Tarant.  I also informed them that they were too late...  He had just departed on the Zephyr and there was nothing they could do about it...  or so I had thought...}{I told them that I had made him a passport... that he had chosen Preston Radcliffe as his name, a gnome from Tarant.  I also informed them that they were too late...  He had just departed on the Zephyr and there was nothing they could do about it...  or so I had thought...}{}{}{}{}
{145}{What did they do?}{}{5}{}{147}{}
{146}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{147}{They were "insistent" that I give them information on how to get to the Zephyr.  I laughed bitterly and told them they were out of their minds...  Crazy old Maxim, had built the Zephyr in his factory outside of town, and it was a one of a kind beast...}{They were "insistent" that I give them information on how to get to the Zephyr.  I laughed bitterly and told them they were out of their minds...  Crazy old Maxim, had built the Zephyr in his factory outside of town, and it was a one of a kind beast...}{}{}{}{}
{148}{You told them where the factory was?}{}{5}{}{150}{}
{149}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{150}{I thought nothing of it.  Everyone knew where Maxim's factory was...  It was that very night that it was burnt to the ground.  That is all I know.}{I thought nothing of it.  Everyone knew where Maxim's factory was...  It was that very night that it was burnt to the ground.  That is all I know.}{}{}{}{}
